aywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the adapter between RevenueCat’s SDK and Swidux’s purchase-agnostic paywall plugin. The plugin owns paywall state (presentation flags, current entitlement, async progress); this package translates RevenueCat’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"CustomerInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" into the ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the plugin expects, and surfaces the live ","type":"text"},{"code":"customerInfoStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so entitlement changes propagate without polling.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two products ship together:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" (the live "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer) and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" (a controllable preview \/ test conformer)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywall(isPresented:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatCustomerCenter(isPresented:)"},{"type":"text","text":", drop-in SwiftUI view modifiers that wrap RevenueCatUI with platform-aware presentation, plus a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywall(state:send:)"},{"type":"text","text":" convenience that composes both."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The flow:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["View → store.send(.paywall(.request(reason:)))","  → PaywallPlugin sets isPresented = true","  → revenu